  "body": "<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:__ISC_BRAND_NAVIGATION_COLOR__;\">Lifecycle state change</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#333333;\">An identity's lifecycle state has been updated in SailPoint Identity Security Cloud.</p>\n<div style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:12px 16px;border-left:4px solid __ISC_BRAND_ACTION_COLOR__;background-color:#f5f7fa;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#333333;\"><strong style=\"color:__ISC_BRAND_NAVIGATION_COLOR__;\">Identity:</strong> ${identityName}</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#333333;\"><strong style=\"color:__ISC_BRAND_NAVIGATION_COLOR__;\">New lifecycle state:</strong> $newState</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#333333;\">Thank you,<br/>The ${PRODUCT_NAME} team</p>",
